\\ The emit before a request is reported; the one after it needs a reply.
\\ > emit "before": 1
\\ > host request 0: Store.put 2
\\ > outcome: none (waiting for the host's reply; run has no host)
(effect Store durable (put I64 --> I64))
(define main {I64 --> I64}
  input -> (do (emit "before" 1)
               (let r (perform Store put 2)
                 (do (emit "after" r) r))))
